#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_de_hr_attendance_arbzg/models/hr_attendance.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s worked %(hours)s hours according to the attendances; at most "
"%(maximum)s hours are allowed (§ 3 ArbZG). The attendances stay as recorded."
msgstr "%(employee)s hat laut Anwesenheit %(hours)s Std. gearbeitet, erlaubt sind höchstens %(maximum)s Std. (§ 3 ArbZG). Die Anwesenheiten bleiben wie erfasst."

